      "message": "[error] Line 350: 🔴 `applyingRemote_` is set back to false before calling `reconcileLists()`. Creating/removing QTextList membership can emit `contentsChange`, so a remote delta that changes list formatting may be echoed as a local edit and sent back to the CRDT. Keep `applyingRemote_` true until after `reconcileLists()` completes, preferably with a small scoped guard so all remote-side document mutations are suppressed consistently.",
