      "message": "[error] Line 493: 🔴 `pasteText()` mutates the document with `applyingRemote_ \u003d\u003d false`, so replacing a selection emits a delete delta before the insert happens, then a second insert delta. That allows peers to observe an intermediate state and can interleave incorrectly with concurrent edits. Wrap the remove+insert in `applyingRemote_`, then emit one explicit delta containing retain/delete/insert for the whole paste operation, or otherwise ensure the replacement is sent atomically.",
